      "body": "Cell 24 (`2baf9d36`, `train_loss_metrics(output, batch[\"forecast\"])`) fails with a shape mismatch: `output` is a per-sample scalar of size `(2,)`, but `batch[\"forecast\"]` is `(2, 1, 4096, 4096)` \u2014 a full spatial map, not a scalar target. Let me check the dataset code to see what `forecast` is supposed to represent.",
      "raw_time": false,
      "time": 1789570279.6281383,
